	(text "fs and MCLK ratio set in firmware (datasheet: 8-96 kHz; SCKI 256/384/512 fs).\nMD1 = MD0 = GND: slave mode, ratio auto-detected. FMT low via R1001 = 24-bit I2S.\nInputs AC-coupled on the baseband sheets (1u film); VINL/R biased internally at VCC/2.\nVREF, VCC, VDD: 10u + 100n each (DS 10.1.1, 10.1.4)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142.24 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
